        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Miranda Cosgrove\n- Songs: \"Kissin U\"\n- Albums: \"Sparks Fly\"\n- Television Shows: \"iCarly\"\n- Organizations: Guinness World Records\n\nFacts:\n- Miranda Cosgrove was born on May 14, 1993.\n- Miranda Cosgrove is an American actress, singer, and songwriter.\n- \"Kissin U\" is a song by Miranda Cosgrove from her debut studio album \"Sparks Fly\".\n- As of May 2010, Miranda Cosgrove earned $180,000 per episode of \"iCarly\", making her the second-highest-paid child star on television.\n- In 2012, Guinness World Records listed Miranda Cosgrove as the highest paid child actress.",
